        OPTAGENT: Optimizing Multi-Agent LLM Interactions Through Verbal <span class="search-hit mathjax">Reinforcement</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Learning</span> for Enhanced Reasoning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
