        Efficient Algorithms for Mitigating Uncertainty and Risk in <span class="search-hit mathjax">Reinforcement</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Learning</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Su%2C+X">Xihong Su</a>
      
